# Local-only ignore for the bug-reproductions whitelist.
# The root .gitignore whitelists the whole subtree via `!docs/bug-reproductions/**`
# so .DS_Store slips through; this file re-ignores OS junk so editors can dump
# their bookkeeping files without committing them. Intended tracking surface is
# source-controlled only.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp